WEBVTT

00:10.460 --> 00:10.880
Hmm?

00:16.170 --> 00:19.710
Please notice these feelings I can't tell you

00:19.710 --> 00:25.880
I'll try to make you see with these skewed and clumsy words

00:26.130 --> 00:29.040
Just for you

00:38.290 --> 00:41.250
I always hide what I mean

00:41.250 --> 00:43.670
(so you don't realize my heart is pounding)

00:43.750 --> 00:48.880
It's all your fault for being far too stunning

00:49.130 --> 00:51.920
No way I can be cute

00:51.920 --> 00:53.670
(I mean, that's not me, is it?)

00:53.670 --> 00:56.500
Even the sky reflected in those eyes

00:56.500 --> 00:59.790
I can't bear to gaze at it straight on

00:59.790 --> 01:05.170
How long am I going to live in this world full of lies?

01:05.170 --> 01:10.080
I'll never manage to change anything at this rate

01:10.250 --> 01:12.790
I don't want that to happen

01:12.790 --> 01:18.920
Even if a god were to speak for me and tell you how I feel

01:18.920 --> 01:24.210
Someday, I want to tell you in my own words that I love you

01:24.460 --> 01:32.960
Even if the words are skewed,
before this precious feeling disappears somewhere

01:33.460 --> 01:36.170
I promise I'll find the courage

01:46.290 --> 01:50.290
<b>Chapter 7</b>

01:46.290 --> 01:50.290
<b>The Prophesy, the Little Boy, and the Live Broadcast</b>

01:46.920 --> 01:48.540
What?! Why is His Highness...?!

01:48.540 --> 01:51.790
What was I...? Where...? What? How?!

01:51.920 --> 01:53.630
Well, of course.

01:53.630 --> 01:57.040
Fiancé or not, it's a princess carry.

01:57.210 --> 01:58.750
Of course she's going to be flustered.

01:58.750 --> 01:59.750
Ah...

02:00.420 --> 02:02.380
Calm yourself down, Liese.

02:02.380 --> 02:06.460
You fainted, and His Highness escorted you home.

02:06.460 --> 02:07.210
Huh?!

02:13.380 --> 02:15.830
M-my apologies, Your Highness!

02:17.420 --> 02:19.250
There's no need to apologize.

02:19.580 --> 02:21.710
I'm your fiancé, after all.

02:22.210 --> 02:24.380
In fact, I'm sorry for startling you like this.

02:24.750 --> 02:26.540
Get some good rest today.

02:26.830 --> 02:28.790
I'll take my leave now.

02:35.250 --> 02:35.880
Uh?

02:36.580 --> 02:37.920
N-no!

02:38.290 --> 02:40.790
Your Highness, this is a misunderstanding!

02:41.040 --> 02:44.210
This is only because of a... Because of a dream I had!

02:45.580 --> 02:48.330
I had an unsettling dream that
made me somewhat anxious-

02:48.330 --> 02:50.330
Oh, not that a mere dream could frighten me!

02:50.630 --> 02:52.460
I fear nothing!

02:53.290 --> 02:56.960
Except perhaps, the thought of you leaving my side...

02:58.460 --> 03:00.250
It's not a misunderstanding at all.

03:00.250 --> 03:05.330
Clearly, the only thing Liese-tan fears is
the thought of you growing distant, Sieg.

03:05.630 --> 03:07.580
No. That's not what I meant!

03:08.460 --> 03:09.630
Lieselotte...

03:10.130 --> 03:15.710
So Sieg, your job is to keep indulging Liese-tan
to keep her emotionally stable!

03:15.710 --> 03:18.250
Then I'm sure you'll manage to save her from doom.

03:18.250 --> 03:20.960
And then we can beat the Witch of Yore to a pulp!

03:20.960 --> 03:21.880
Mm-hm!

03:22.380 --> 03:24.080
Yes, on my word.

03:26.790 --> 03:30.330
Not to worry. You and I are engaged.

03:30.330 --> 03:34.630
Even if we are separated for a time,
we can never be truly parted.

03:34.830 --> 03:35.670
Isn't that so?

03:35.670 --> 03:36.630
Your Highness...!

03:38.290 --> 03:42.040
True. I am your fiancée, after all.

03:43.880 --> 03:46.710
I promise to save you from your doom.

03:47.420 --> 03:52.630
Sieg patting her head, leading to
Liese-tan's little smile and blushing cheeks?

03:52.880 --> 03:54.540
Cute is the only word that comes to mind!

03:54.830 --> 03:56.000
So precious!

03:56.420 --> 04:01.670
You know, we should really start thinking about
how to go about defeating the Witch of Yore.

04:01.670 --> 04:03.080
Oh, you're right.

04:01.670 --> 04:10.170
<b>Lieselotte</b>

04:01.670 --> 04:10.170
<b>I am your fiancée, after all.</b>

04:03.250 --> 04:07.670
The witch's resurrection happens after
the academy's Festival of Gratitude, right?

04:07.920 --> 04:09.920
We have to come up with something soon.

04:10.880 --> 04:12.920
So I was thinking, Your Holiness Kobayashi,

04:12.920 --> 04:18.420
we gods should convene to discuss strategy after
the first assembly of the semester tomorrow.

04:18.710 --> 04:19.540
What do you think?

04:19.830 --> 04:22.420
Oh, yeah. That's a great idea, Your Holiness Endo!

04:22.420 --> 04:24.420
<b>Riefenstahl Villa</b>

04:22.420 --> 04:24.420
<b>Lieselotte</b>

04:22.420 --> 04:24.420
<b>I am your fiancée, after all.</b>

04:22.710 --> 04:23.540
Let's do that!

04:26.670 --> 04:29.170
<b>Hanahashi Ikuei High School</b>

04:26.670 --> 04:29.170
<b>Intramural Ball</b>

04:26.670 --> 04:29.170
<b>Sports Tournament</b>

04:29.380 --> 04:34.420
And now, I hereby call this Divine Conference to
Determine the Fate of the Other World to order.

04:40.290 --> 04:41.250
Oh, come on!

04:41.750 --> 04:43.880
You're the one who started it, Endo!

04:46.630 --> 04:49.170
But anyway, let's have fun with this.

04:49.420 --> 04:54.880
Sounds good. We got to tell Sieg and them what's
going on, and Lieselotte seems to be in a better place.

04:54.880 --> 04:56.790
Plus you were having a heck of a time.

04:59.630 --> 05:02.330
I-I'm so sorry for what I did!

05:02.710 --> 05:04.750
Uh, hey. No sweat, it's fine!

05:04.750 --> 05:08.500
Anyway, now we just need to figure out
how to take on the Witch of Yore.

05:08.500 --> 05:09.290
Yeah.

05:09.790 --> 05:13.670
Weren't they able to defeat the witch
in the Reverse Harem Route?

05:14.080 --> 05:14.960
That's right.

05:15.380 --> 05:19.630
Then don't we just have to assemble
all the potential love interests together?

05:20.040 --> 05:22.580
Oh, I see. You're right!

05:22.790 --> 05:24.210
Sieg and Bal...

05:24.210 --> 05:25.290
I think we're good there.

05:26.130 --> 05:27.420
Art, well...

05:27.420 --> 05:28.750
Just leave it up to me!

05:29.710 --> 05:31.460
Fabby-boo is a question mark.

05:31.460 --> 05:33.040
Huh? Hmm...

05:34.710 --> 05:36.290
And Professor Leon...

05:36.290 --> 05:38.460
Uh? Why should I?

05:39.710 --> 05:44.630
Argh! I just can't imagine Professor Leon
would ever agree to cooperate!

05:44.630 --> 05:47.130
Is he that tough to deal with?

05:47.380 --> 05:48.130
Yeah.

05:48.420 --> 05:51.580
He's disingenuous because of a complicated upbringing,

05:51.580 --> 05:54.750
and he uses forbidden curses
that have to be kept secret.

05:54.920 --> 06:00.330
So getting him to join the fight requires something big,
like making him fall in love with Fiene.

06:00.330 --> 06:01.920
That's super tricky!

06:02.210 --> 06:06.330
But the Witch of Yore could destroy
the kingdom or even the world, right?

06:06.670 --> 06:09.540
So why doesn't the crown do anything?

06:09.540 --> 06:10.040
Huh!

06:10.250 --> 06:11.630
True! That's so true!

06:11.630 --> 06:12.920
Liese-tan's dad is a general!

06:13.210 --> 06:17.670
Lieselotte and Fiene are in trouble,
so it only makes sense to ask him to cooperate!

06:17.670 --> 06:18.790
Right?!

06:19.210 --> 06:22.540
If we get the general to mobilize his men or knights
or whatever, we've got nothing to fear!

06:23.170 --> 06:27.750
All right! Let's give up on Professor Leon and
focus on Liese-tan's dad, Art, and Fabby-boo!

06:28.500 --> 06:30.670
So with Art, for starters-

06:38.830 --> 06:39.710
Miss Fiene!

06:40.080 --> 06:40.920
Your Highness.

06:40.920 --> 06:42.080
You came, too?

06:42.080 --> 06:44.380
Yes, Lord Endoe called me here.

06:44.830 --> 06:46.960
Oh, you both came!

06:47.330 --> 06:48.500
Yes, right here.

06:48.500 --> 06:51.460
We're about to deliver a prophesy.

06:55.170 --> 07:00.420
On the last day of the school festival after the ball,
the Witch of Yore will revive.

07:02.250 --> 07:08.210
In order to save Lieselotte and defeat the Witch of Yore,
there are some things we need you two to do.

07:08.210 --> 07:09.960
Of course. Whatever you suggest.

07:10.500 --> 07:17.210
First of all Sieg, to get help in fighting the witch,
we want you to get Art and Fabby-boo on our side.

07:17.630 --> 07:19.500
"Fabby...boo"?

07:19.500 --> 07:20.460
"Boo"?

07:21.750 --> 07:25.750
Ideally, we wanted Professor Leon's help
but that doesn't seem likely,

07:25.880 --> 07:30.080
so we want Fiene to explain the situation to
Marquis Riefenstahl and ask for his cooperation.

07:30.330 --> 07:31.000
Right!

07:31.290 --> 07:34.040
We have received your divine words.

07:34.210 --> 07:36.710
If it's to save my sister, I'll do the best I can!

07:37.830 --> 07:38.630
Hmm?

07:43.080 --> 07:45.710
Oh, what perfect timing for Art to appear!

07:49.460 --> 07:51.540
A quest to destroy the Witch of Yore?

07:52.460 --> 07:56.330
That might actually be a job for me,
being a priest and all.

07:56.670 --> 07:57.420
Then...

07:57.420 --> 07:58.000
Sure!

07:58.290 --> 08:00.420
I'm always on your side, no matter what.

08:01.830 --> 08:03.880
That's great! Thank you.

08:04.460 --> 08:06.670
All right. Now comes the hard part.

08:13.790 --> 08:15.540
Is Sieg gonna be okay?

08:15.540 --> 08:21.540
Fabby-boo was nearly abducted multiple times by
pervy nobles because of his powers and adorable looks,

08:21.960 --> 08:25.040
so he's had an aversion to tall, grown men ever since!

08:25.460 --> 08:28.000
Figuring out the right moment to talk to him is tricky.

08:30.000 --> 08:30.920
Your Highness.

08:31.830 --> 08:34.040
Whatever are you doing there?

08:34.210 --> 08:35.290
Lieselotte?!

08:35.420 --> 08:37.460
Uh, well...you see...

08:37.460 --> 08:39.290
Oh? Isn't that...

08:39.750 --> 08:41.250
the Fabian boy?

08:42.290 --> 08:48.290
A-actually, I was hoping to talk to him,
but then I remembered he has an aversion to grown men.

08:48.290 --> 08:51.790
If that's all you need, allow me to help.

08:51.790 --> 08:53.080
Huh? But...

08:53.420 --> 08:56.830
Need I remind you that I have four younger sisters?

08:57.210 --> 09:01.080
Three of them, I may well have raised them on my own.

09:01.380 --> 09:03.880
I'm quite adept at dealing with young children.

09:04.880 --> 09:09.290
You're right. You do look like you would
make a kind and wonderful mother.

09:09.290 --> 09:11.830
Whoa, that's a pretty gutsy comment, Your Highness!

09:11.830 --> 09:16.130
I feel like saying that to your fiancée borders
on minor sexual harassment.

09:16.500 --> 09:17.750
Sexual... what now?

09:20.080 --> 09:22.920
What... whatever are you on about?!

09:22.920 --> 09:27.880
Of course I intend on treating my own child
with love and care, but it seems a little early...

09:28.080 --> 09:32.830
Well, of course I realize that at sixteen
I am eligible for marriage, legally speaking...

09:33.080 --> 09:34.500
...but I couldn't...

09:34.880 --> 09:38.380
Oh! Liese-tan seems pretty pleased,
so I think you're in the clear!

09:38.790 --> 09:40.500
Ah, adorable.

09:41.290 --> 09:43.290
Oh, honestly!

09:44.000 --> 09:46.330
Let us dispense with this foolishness and get on with it.

09:46.830 --> 09:50.000
Of course, I fully intend on living up to your expectations.

09:50.170 --> 09:50.750
Huh?

09:51.790 --> 09:56.170
Do you mean about Fabian? Or about our future child?!

09:56.170 --> 09:57.420
Which is it?!

10:01.250 --> 10:01.960
Hmm?

10:02.710 --> 10:04.420
Hello, there. Uh...

10:10.460 --> 10:11.420
So listen...

10:22.790 --> 10:24.580
Could you spare a moment of your time?

10:25.920 --> 10:27.170
S-sure.

10:28.670 --> 10:31.210
Then what if you get attacked with ice?

10:31.580 --> 10:32.580
Let's see...

10:32.830 --> 10:37.210
Ice magic not only results in a temperature change,
but also deals a physical blow.

10:37.500 --> 10:41.330
So I would prioritize protecting yourself
with a shielding spell.

10:41.880 --> 10:43.790
Another unlikely rival.

10:41.880 --> 10:43.420
Oh, that makes sense.

10:43.880 --> 10:48.330
What? Who would have expected
these two to hit it off so well?

10:43.880 --> 10:46.920
Then attacking with fire would be an effective move.

10:47.420 --> 10:49.330
See, because ice is weak against fire.

10:48.420 --> 10:50.460
Liese-tan's the quintessential older sister.

10:49.330 --> 10:49.960
Yeah!

10:50.580 --> 10:53.630
I suppose she meshes well with the younger Fabby-boo.

10:55.540 --> 10:57.960
You explain things so well, Miss!

11:00.750 --> 11:01.630
You're so cute.

11:04.080 --> 11:08.630
Well, I was just as cute when I was younger... I think.

11:08.630 --> 11:11.250
Wait, why am I comparing him to my past self?!

11:11.920 --> 11:14.040
Can I call you Miss Liese?

11:14.040 --> 11:17.880
"Liese"?! I've never called her that, and I'm her fiancé!

11:14.040 --> 11:16.290
Of course, I would love that.

11:16.500 --> 11:19.830
I'm sure it would be lovely having a younger brother like you.

11:21.920 --> 11:25.460
Yikes, I've never seen Sieg make a face like that!

11:25.460 --> 11:28.670
Oh, I don't think there's reason for concern!
At least not yet.

11:28.920 --> 11:31.330
But give him five years, and who knows?

11:31.330 --> 11:32.460
Five years?

11:42.380 --> 11:44.330
You caaaaaaan't!

11:44.330 --> 11:46.040
Your Highness? Is something the matter?

11:46.040 --> 11:52.210
Oh... well...! The sun is starting to set,
so I thought we can't stay out here much longer...

11:52.630 --> 11:56.460
Quite true. I'm sorry for keeping you, Fabian.

11:56.460 --> 11:58.710
Next time, I hope we can meet at my home.

11:58.710 --> 12:00.380
Sure, Miss Liese.

12:05.290 --> 12:08.210
So... you invited Fabian to your home?

12:08.420 --> 12:12.210
Yes, I hope to introduce him to my sisters.

12:12.210 --> 12:13.790
I... see...

12:15.130 --> 12:17.960
Well, there's no doubt he's on our side now,

12:18.420 --> 12:20.580
but Lord Endoh, Lady Kobayashee...

12:21.880 --> 12:25.670
I'm not sure I'll manage to keep myself together.

12:27.880 --> 12:31.290
Art and Fabby-boo... Got 'em! Yes!

12:31.790 --> 12:36.420
By the way, Sieg looked like he wanted
to say something at the end there.

12:36.040 --> 12:40.000
<b>The Royal Academy of Magic-Courtyard</b>

12:36.040 --> 12:40.000
<b>Siegwald</b>

12:36.040 --> 12:40.000
<b>I... see...</b>

12:37.040 --> 12:38.960
Or maybe I'm just imagining things.

12:41.420 --> 12:47.750
The first round of boys' basketball is about to begin,
with Class 1-5 up against Class 3-3.

12:42.580 --> 12:44.750
<b>Hanahashi Ikuei High School</b>

12:42.580 --> 12:44.750
<b>Intramural Ball</b>

12:42.590 --> 12:44.750
<b>Sports Tournament</b>

12:48.130 --> 12:51.880
Those who want to cheer them on should
hurry over to Gymnasium #1.

12:53.540 --> 12:56.040
Impressive, Kobayashi. You're so used to this.

12:56.130 --> 12:57.580
Aw, you think so?

12:57.920 --> 13:00.750
But you've gotten really good at this too, Endo.

13:00.750 --> 13:05.380
If I have, it's all thanks to you.
I got a lot of practice doing commentary on the game.

13:06.500 --> 13:10.790
Oh, I know! Why don't we do a commentary
and analysis for the next game?

13:10.790 --> 13:11.420
Huh?

13:14.170 --> 13:15.920
This is such a close game!

13:15.920 --> 13:18.170
The third-years make a pass to jersey #4!

13:20.130 --> 13:23.540
And now, he makes a break for it and shoots!

13:25.540 --> 13:27.750
Scooore! It went in!

13:27.750 --> 13:30.500
He did it! Third-year #4 makes an amazing shot!

13:30.500 --> 13:32.040
The score is 40 to 33!

13:30.500 --> 13:33.290
<b>Year 3</b>

13:30.500 --> 13:33.290
<b>Class 2</b>

13:30.500 --> 13:33.290
<b>Year 1</b>

13:30.500 --> 13:33.290
<b>Class 1</b>

13:33.580 --> 13:35.630
The third-years ran away with the lead!

13:35.630 --> 13:37.710
But the first-years did a great job, too.

13:37.710 --> 13:39.880
You two having fun, huh?

13:40.830 --> 13:41.540
Prez!

13:41.960 --> 13:45.290
That's sounding great. You should actually
broadcast that for the final game.

13:45.290 --> 13:46.290
Huuhh?!

13:47.040 --> 13:48.170
I'm counting on you two!

14:00.170 --> 14:03.790
Th-there goes the tip-off! It's the boys' basketball finals.

14:03.790 --> 14:08.080
It's Class 1-3 against Class 2-5! Which side will prevail?!

14:08.080 --> 14:10.670
In charge of the running commentary is me, um, Endo...

14:10.670 --> 14:13.290
with expert analysis by me, Kobayashi!

14:14.210 --> 14:15.580
Commentary by Endo?

14:15.580 --> 14:17.170
And analysis by Kobayashi?

14:17.830 --> 14:19.580
<b>Year 2</b>

14:17.830 --> 14:19.580
<b>Class 5</b>

14:17.840 --> 14:19.580
<b>Year 1</b>

14:17.840 --> 14:19.580
<b>Class 3</b>

14:20.000 --> 14:21.750
The first-years have possession of the ball!

14:22.080 --> 14:24.920
First-year jersey #5 breaks away
from a second-year and passes!

14:24.920 --> 14:27.170
First-year jersey #3 hangs on to the ball!

14:27.170 --> 14:29.580
They're fast! It's like they're using magic.

14:29.750 --> 14:32.460
But wait, here's a group of
second-years set on cutting him off!

14:32.460 --> 14:34.130
Jersey #3 makes a quick pass!

14:34.330 --> 14:36.040
Over to jersey #7!

14:36.040 --> 14:38.210
Jersey #7 is awfully tall.

14:38.460 --> 14:40.670
It's Class 1-3's big man!

14:40.670 --> 14:42.960
Oh, but what's this? He seems stuck!

14:43.250 --> 14:46.790
Well, classes tend to pick tall people
assuming they're good at basketball.

14:46.790 --> 14:48.330
Not the most precise strategy.

14:48.830 --> 14:50.670
But I think this one might surprise us!

14:51.670 --> 14:54.250
Oh! And now that #7 takes a shot!

14:55.710 --> 14:58.080
He scores a three-pointer!

14:58.080 --> 15:01.040
If he always scores this well,
midterm exams should be a breeze for him, too!

15:01.500 --> 15:02.960
What's with that commentary?

15:02.960 --> 15:03.880
Let's go check it out!

15:04.250 --> 15:05.880
Ooh, time's running out fast!

15:05.880 --> 15:06.750
So's my money!

15:06.750 --> 15:07.920
Okay, that's irrelevant.

15:11.210 --> 15:13.750
It's very close with 20 seconds left on the clock!

15:13.750 --> 15:14.880
This is their last chance!

15:15.460 --> 15:18.580
If this three-pointer goes in it
will completely turn the tables!

15:18.580 --> 15:20.380
Will he be a hero?!

15:22.130 --> 15:23.880
And the game ends here!

15:22.630 --> 15:24.630
<b>Year 2</b>

15:22.630 --> 15:24.630
<b>Class 5</b>

15:22.630 --> 15:24.630
<b>Year 1</b>

15:22.630 --> 15:24.630
<b>Class 3</b>

15:23.880 --> 15:27.500
The first-years have won the finals!

15:30.330 --> 15:31.790
Good work, you two!

15:32.290 --> 15:34.290
Really, you were great!

15:34.290 --> 15:36.170
You really got the crowd going.

15:36.170 --> 15:38.170
It was like a husband-wife comedy routine.

15:38.460 --> 15:40.040
Uh, thank you-?

15:40.040 --> 15:41.580
Oh, you lovebirds!

15:42.000 --> 15:43.830
Get the heck outta here!

15:50.210 --> 15:51.960
Oh, there they are! The lovebirds!

15:51.960 --> 15:53.170
Congratulations!

15:53.580 --> 15:56.960
"Lovebirds"?! Jeez, this is awkward.

15:58.580 --> 16:03.130
Oh, but with the intramural tournament over,
we can finally get back to playing Magikoi!

16:03.130 --> 16:04.000
Yeah!

16:15.000 --> 16:21.330
Oh dear... The marquis is finally back from
his inspections but he's staying at the royal palace?

16:22.630 --> 16:24.250
Are you all right, Fiene?

16:24.250 --> 16:25.920
Do I look all right?

16:26.330 --> 16:29.460
I'm not used to all these important people or the palace.

16:29.710 --> 16:31.380
My heart won't stop pounding.

16:34.500 --> 16:39.420
Uh...?! Does this mean...
well, um... what I think it means?

16:41.210 --> 16:41.920
Huh?

16:43.080 --> 16:47.830
No! We're not here to announce
our impending marriage or anything like that!

16:47.830 --> 16:49.790
Oh, it isn't?

16:50.170 --> 16:53.960
I-I just had him hold my hand because I was nervous.

16:54.130 --> 16:58.080
I'm continuing my efforts so that
I might one day make that announcement.

16:59.080 --> 17:00.920
Good. Win her or die trying.

17:00.920 --> 17:01.460
Yes, sir!

17:02.210 --> 17:04.880
Then tell me, what did you wish to discuss today?

17:06.670 --> 17:09.210
Are you experiencing any difficulties living with us?

17:09.210 --> 17:10.290
Of course not!

17:10.460 --> 17:14.080
Lieselotte is so kind,
and you've even let my mother live with us.

17:14.250 --> 17:15.670
I'm so very grateful.

17:15.960 --> 17:17.290
That's good to hear.

17:17.960 --> 17:21.130
What I came to discuss today is about Lieselotte.

17:22.000 --> 17:24.290
It has to do with her life being in danger.

17:25.170 --> 17:25.960
Hmm?!

17:29.330 --> 17:36.630
I had no idea of these developments.
I'm a failure of a father for not noticing at all.

17:37.330 --> 17:41.960
Just the other day, His Highness
escorted Lieselotte home.

17:43.710 --> 17:44.540
Liese!

17:49.630 --> 17:55.540
That's when I thought, "Ah, my daughter's
dream has come true at last!"

17:56.080 --> 18:00.040
Her dream since childhood that I went and suppressed.

18:01.460 --> 18:05.960
I won't let this Witch of Yore
take my daughter after all that!

18:06.630 --> 18:11.040
I swear I shall use everything
within my power to protect Liese.

18:12.210 --> 18:14.830
As well as you, of course, Miss Fiene.

18:15.130 --> 18:17.210
Th-thank you so much.

18:17.210 --> 18:18.750
Time to clinch the deal, Fiene!

18:18.750 --> 18:20.790
Go on and call him "Father"!

18:23.750 --> 18:27.040
...F... Father.

18:29.080 --> 18:31.460
Fiene just called me "Father "!

18:35.210 --> 18:39.790
Baldur! If you wish to wed this girl,
you shall have to go through me first!

18:39.790 --> 18:40.420
Uh?

18:43.540 --> 18:48.380
I refuse to marry her off just yet!
I shall protect her now in my brother's stead!

18:49.130 --> 18:52.080
If you intend to get in my way of marrying Miss Fiene,

18:52.080 --> 18:54.580
I will cut you down, be it Your Excellency or not!

18:59.330 --> 19:01.330
Uh... Huh?!

19:01.330 --> 19:03.790
What a waste of their warrior aura.

19:03.790 --> 19:07.880
Fiene, please stop them before
they spill blood in the royal palace!

19:09.380 --> 19:10.670
Oh, come on!

19:15.250 --> 19:19.380
The question of when and who I marry is up to me.

19:20.380 --> 19:22.210
Up to me, you hear?!

19:22.290 --> 19:23.170
Understood.

19:23.170 --> 19:24.460
My apologies...

19:26.080 --> 19:28.710
Fiene, you're cute. Adorable, even!

19:28.710 --> 19:31.210
But you pack such a hefty punch!

19:31.580 --> 19:33.250
I'm in love all over again.

19:40.420 --> 19:42.630
I love you, Fiene.

19:46.170 --> 19:50.330
I never thought there could be
an "I love you" that brings so little joy.

19:51.330 --> 19:53.420
Is Bal a masochist or something?

19:53.670 --> 20:01.710
Bal just loves Fiene way too much. Forget about whether
he has a quirk for now, and at least give him an answer.

20:04.380 --> 20:12.500
Sir Bal, I'm sorry. You telling me how strong I am and
exalting me for it doesn't make me happy in the slightest.

20:12.960 --> 20:17.210
There were always people coming after my life.

20:17.790 --> 20:21.580
As I struggled to live to see another day,
I just ended up getting strong.

20:22.130 --> 20:23.380
That's all there is to it.

20:24.750 --> 20:29.580
Strength that comes from almost getting
killed isn't anything to be proud about.

20:30.540 --> 20:35.130
If anything, I'm dismayed at how strong I've become.

20:38.540 --> 20:44.830
All right. Then I'll make sure you never have to wield your
fists again by getting strong enough for the both of us.

20:45.580 --> 20:46.170
Huh?

20:46.500 --> 20:53.170
If I get to be so strong that I can say you're no big deal,
Fiene, you won't have anything to worry about.

20:53.420 --> 20:55.540
Stronger than me?

20:56.790 --> 20:58.830
Someone stronger than me,

20:59.330 --> 21:02.580
who won't ever die on me or get defeated.

21:03.210 --> 21:05.330
Oh, I see now...

21:05.710 --> 21:10.210
This... is what I needed to hear.

21:11.040 --> 21:14.540
If it was for your sake, I would slay the gods if I had to.

21:15.380 --> 21:19.170
I'll defeat the Witch of Yore myself, too.
That's how strong I'll get.

21:19.790 --> 21:21.750
And when I do, I want you to marry me.

21:22.080 --> 21:27.040
I want you to acknowledge me as
the only one fit to stand by your side.

21:34.000 --> 21:35.290
All right!

21:37.040 --> 21:38.630
Way to go, Bal!

21:38.630 --> 21:40.500
Aw, Bal! Good for you!

21:39.250 --> 21:41.750
<b>Royal Palace-Hallway</b>

21:39.250 --> 21:41.750
<b>Baldur</b>

21:39.250 --> 21:41.750
<b>I want you to acknowledge me as the only one fit to stand by your side.</b>

21:50.670 --> 21:53.830
So I hear you called Bruno "Father," huh?!

21:54.630 --> 21:55.290
Mommy?!

21:56.460 --> 22:00.880
You asked Bruno to cooperate
in order to protect Lieselotte, hmm?

22:01.670 --> 22:04.790
Sounds good. Take advantage of everything you can!

22:04.790 --> 22:06.380
"Take advantage of"?

22:06.920 --> 22:09.960
Apparently they wanted to ask
for Professor Leon's help as well,

22:09.960 --> 22:11.790
but they say it might be difficult.

22:12.250 --> 22:15.750
"Leon"? The one with chestnut hair and slits for eyes?

22:15.750 --> 22:16.880
Leon Schach?

22:17.290 --> 22:18.210
You know him?

22:18.790 --> 22:19.540
You could say that.

22:20.580 --> 22:22.880
I might be able to do something about that.

22:23.040 --> 22:23.670
Huh?!

22:43.670 --> 22:49.630
Your smile is so stunning it almost hurts

22:49.630 --> 22:55.290
Even now, I can't look at it straight on

22:55.750 --> 23:01.880
The feelings scattered in the depths of my heart

23:01.880 --> 23:07.540
It's as if I'm gathering them bit by bit

23:08.500 --> 23:14.250
Do the stars in the night sky

23:15.250 --> 23:20.330
...see everything? ...know everything?

23:21.420 --> 23:26.960
I open the window and ask of them

23:27.580 --> 23:30.960
Why?

23:32.750 --> 23:38.920
This world is filled with glimmering light

23:39.040 --> 23:45.040
It was your smile that taught me so

23:45.040 --> 23:51.040
I can't help but wish for a happy ending

23:51.420 --> 24:01.250
If only I can stay by your side

24:01.250 --> 24:03.080
Forevermore

24:07.460 --> 24:09.420
Forevermore

24:13.710 --> 24:17.210
That was so much fun, doing the commentary
and analysis for that basketball game!

24:17.210 --> 24:20.710
Endo! Now we can focus all our attention on Magikoi!

24:20.710 --> 24:21.460
Yeah!

24:21.460 --> 24:24.500
Next Episode: Master and Disciple, the Mask,
and Tsundereally-Pissed.

24:24.500 --> 24:26.500
Uh, who was that?! He butted right in!

24:24.960 --> 24:27.960
<b>Master and Disciple, the Mask, and Tsundereally-Pissed</b>
